      </floats-group>
      <floats-group id="article-169387.s16">
        <fig id="article-169387.image.f3" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Diagnostic Laryngoscopy of a Type I Laryngeal Cleft Before Palpation. Microlaryngoscopy and bronchoscopy with palpation of the interarytenoid space is the gold standard for laryngeal cleft diagnosis. Contributed by R De Jong, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="LC__diagnostic__DL" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
